---
config:
  themeCSS: ".messageText {stroke:#ffffff !important;stroke-width:4px !important;paint-order:stroke;stroke-linejoin:round;} .actor-line {stroke-dasharray:6 5;stroke:#999999;}"
  sequence:
    actorMargin: 35
    messageMargin: 25
    mirrorActors: false
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant B as executingBroker:<br/>«FinancialInstitution»<br/>ExecutingBroker
    participant C as centralMatchingUtility:<br/>«System»<br/>CentralMatchingUtility
    participant P as primeBroker:<br/>«FinancialInstitution»<br/>PrimeBroker
    B->>+C: SecuritiesTradeConfirmation
    deactivate C
    C->>+P: SecuritiesTradeConfirmationStatusAdvice
    deactivate P
    C->>+B: SecuritiesTradeConfirmationStatusAdvice
    deactivate B
    P->>+C: SecuritiesTradeConfirmation
    deactivate C
    C->>+B: SecuritiesTradeConfirmationStatusAdvice
    deactivate B
    C->>+P: SecuritiesTradeConfirmationStatusAdvice
    deactivate P
    B->>+C: SecuritiesTradeConfirmationCancellation
    deactivate C
    P->>+C: SecuritiesTradeConfirmationCancellation
    deactivate C
    C->>+B: SecuritiesTradeConfirmationStatusAdvice
    deactivate B
    C->>+P: SecuritiesTradeConfirmationStatusAdvice
    deactivate P
    Note over B,P: This also applies for Securities Financing Or Off exchange.
